                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The patch &lt;a href="https://review.whamcloud.com/62757" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/62757&lt;/a&gt; ("&lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12669" title="FLR-EC: recover data from parity code" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-12669"&gt;LU-12669&lt;/a&gt; ec: recover data from parity") does not handle AIO+DIO or io_uring async read reconstruction.  This would need to be handled before the 2.18.0 release.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
